  24:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****   ==============================================================================
  25:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****                ##### I2C peripheral Extended features  #####
  26:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****   ==============================================================================
  27:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c_ex.c **** 
  28:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****   [..] Comparing to other previous devices, the I2C interface for STM32G4xx
  29:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****        devices contains the following additional features
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccEGihsc.s 			page 2


  30:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c_ex.c **** 
  31:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****        (+) Possibility to disable or enable Analog Noise Filter
  32:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****        (+) Use of a configured Digital Noise Filter
  33:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****        (+) Disable or enable wakeup from Stop mode(s)
  34:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****        (+) Disable or enable Fast Mode Plus
  35:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c_ex.c **** 
  36:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****                      ##### How to use this driver #####
  37:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****   ==============================================================================
  38:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****   [..] This driver provides functions to configure Noise Filter and Wake Up Feature
  39:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****     (#) Configure I2C Analog noise filter using the function HAL_I2CEx_ConfigAnalogFilter()
  40:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****     (#) Configure I2C Digital noise filter using the function HAL_I2CEx_ConfigDigitalFilter()
  41:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****     (#) Configure the enable or disable of I2C Wake Up Mode using the functions :
  42:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****           (++) HAL_I2CEx_EnableWakeUp()
  43:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****           (++) HAL_I2CEx_DisableWakeUp()
  44:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****     (#) Configure the enable or disable of fast mode plus driving capability using the functions :
  45:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****           (++) HAL_I2CEx_EnableFastModePlus()
  46:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****           (++) HAL_I2CEx_DisableFastModePlus()
  47:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****   @endverbatim
  48:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****   */
