 302:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****   *        I2C1 pins using I2C_FASTMODEPLUS_I2C1 parameter or independently
 303:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****   *        on each one of the following pins PB6, PB7, PB8 and PB9.
